---
description: Native Studium colors and HTML must stay aligned with studium-web theme
globs: Studium/**/*.swift, Studium/Assets.xcassets/**/*.colorset/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- **Source of truth:** Web tokens live in `studium-web/src/index.css` (`:root` light, `html:not(.light)` dark). Native UI uses the same hex values via **Asset Catalog** colorsets.
- **Token table (light / dark):**

| Token | Light | Dark |
|-------|-------|------|
| Accent | `#007AFF` | `#0A84FF` |
| Math | `#007AFF` | `#0A84FF` |
| R&W | `#5856D6` | `#5E5CE6` |
| Background | `#F8FAFC` | `#0F172A` |
| Card | `#FFFFFF` | `#1E293B` |
| Text | `#0F172A` | `#F1F5F9` |
| Muted | `#475569` | `#94A3B8` |

- **Swift mapping:** `PlatformColors.swift` — `systemGroupedBackground` → `StudiumBg`, `systemBackground` → `StudiumCard`, etc. Chip outlines use `Color.studiumBorder`. Accent uses `AccentColor` colorset.
- **Quiz / reference HTML:** `buildHTMLString` / `StudiumHTMLBuilder` use SF Pro in HTML CSS; palette matches web accent `#007AFF`. WKWebView loads with `StudiumHTMLBuilder.contentBaseURL` (CDN).
- **Typography:** Native chrome uses system (SF Pro) via `StudiumDesignSystem`. Web uses Inter. Monospaced only for stats digits, question IDs, and optional vocab roots.
